The GPhoto 1.0 roadmap

Odd number version are development versions only.  They are not stable
releases.  All stable releases will use even number versions.

GPhoto 0.6
   - Remove Imlib dependency, use gdk-pixbuf instead.
   - Followup and fix bugs reported to bugs.gnome.org.
   - Write a GPhoto User Guide in either SGML/DocBook or TexInfo

GPhoto 0.8
   - Write CORBA-based embeddable camera control
   - Write a proxy for libgphoto2
   - Add Gnome Print support
   - Use bugzilla.gnome.org for bug-tracking

